				<Coords points="196,1914 249,1914 251,1902 305,1902 305,1914 324,1914 324,1902 344,1902 344,1914 368,1914 368,1902 389,1902 390,1913 490,1914 492,1926 499,1926 526,1902 546,1902 547,1913 566,1913 566,1901 639,1903 639,1913 695,1913 695,1902 708,1902 708,1912 726,1912 726,1900 794,1900 794,1912 910,1911 910,1899 932,1899 933,1912 1043,1911 1043,1899 1065,1899 1077,1901 1077,1911 1095,1911 1095,1899 1117,1899 1117,1905 1129,1905 1152,1911 1207,1911 1207,1928 995,1930 995,1939 972,1939 950,1930 658,1932 526,1931 499,1937 295,1937 196,1932" />
